00:19:12.550 --> 00:19:14.220
Do you understand, Sosuke?

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:17.670
A yokozuna should be feared and respected.

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:22.520
To become a yokozuna,
you must crush all in your path.

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:24.050
To achieve that...

00:19:24.550 --> 00:19:27.240
you must cease being human.

00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:35.340
They're in a completely
different stratosphere.

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:38.070
That goes for both of them!

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:40.200
<i>Not sideways!</i>

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:41.160
<i>Forward!</i>

00:19:43.670 --> 00:19:45.060
No, it's not working!

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:47.040
How can he attack head-on in this situation?

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:48.910
Isn't he scared?

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:50.550
<i>Sure, I'm scared.</i>

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:53.170
<i>Scared of Kuze, of sumo... But even so...</i>

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.130
Another strike!

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:56.830
<i>...I'll step forward.</i>

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:58.520
<i>I can see it right in front of me...</i>

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:01.660
<i>An adversary who's so close
to being a yokozuna!</i>

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:06.260
<i>A victory that I'm willing
to risk my life for!</i>

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:09.100
A third strike!

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:11.710
<i>No matter how many times
I knock him back, he will not yield!</i>

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:15.770
<i>Yes. This is how you live.</i>

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:17.780
<i>Your style of sumo.</i>

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.540
Hinomaru's hands are inside!

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:22.990
Kusanagi's hands are outside.

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:25.620
They're both in the perfect range
for their killer move!

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:31.450
<i>Heads together. Both hands on your belt.</i>

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:35.750
<i>I came up with this move in order to beat you!</i>

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:39.380
<i>Now, I'll keep shaking you and never stop!</i>

00:20:41.230 --> 00:20:45.010
<i>This is the move I've developed to win!</i>

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:47.740
<i>I won't give you a chance
to start your motion.</i>

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:50.020
<i>I can still fight back from this position.</i>

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:53.480
<i>My father taught me
this right overhand grip.</i>

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:55.150
<i>The move that defines my destiny.</i>

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:57.020
<i>Even one...</i>

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:58.820
<i>...moment's hesitation...</i>

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:00.300
<i>...and I'll lose!</i>

00:22:33.030 --> 00:22:35.540
<i>The two managers were giving sumo a whirl,</i>

00:22:36.050 --> 00:22:37.540
<i>and Hinomaru saw us.</i>

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:39.540
<i>He got an eyeful of panties, too.</i>

00:22:39.820 --> 00:22:43.050
<i>Hinomaru's been acting strange ever since.</i>

00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:46.450
Um... Would... you two...

00:22:47.340 --> 00:22:49.550
N-No, never mind!

00:22:50.130 --> 00:22:53.810
What's gotten into<i> him</i>? It's like
he wants to tell us something.

00:22:54.690 --> 00:22:55.310
Could it be?

00:22:55.690 --> 00:22:58.000
Are we now the objects of his desire,

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:00.190
and he wants us to quit
our roles as club managers,

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:01.900
because we disrupt his concentration?

00:23:02.110 --> 00:23:03.700
Is that the reason?

00:23:03.700 --> 00:23:05.650
Where did that come from, Hori-chan?!

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:09.660
Listen, you! If you've got something 
to say, just come right out and say it!

00:23:10.960 --> 00:23:12.800
Okay... if you insist.

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:16.430
Reina, don't overstretch!

00:23:16.430 --> 00:23:17.120
Better!

00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:18.280
Hori-chan, you're doing well!

00:23:18.280 --> 00:23:19.580
She can't throw you now!

00:23:20.070 --> 00:23:24.590
I know you said to wipe that day from my
memory, but I couldn't get it out of my head!

